{"strongs": "H8267", "word": "שֶׁ֫קֶר", "translit": "she.qer", "root": "שקר", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "deception, disappointment, falsehood", "definition": "שֶׁ֫קֶר 113 noun masculine deception, disappointment, falsehood ; — ׳ שׁ Exod 23:7 + 64 t.; שָׁ֑קֶר Exod 5:9 + 42 t.; plural שְׁקָרִים Ps 101:7 + 3 t.; suffix שִׁקְרֵיהֶם Jer 23:22 — 1. deception , what deceives, disappoints, and betrays one : a molten image Jer 10:14 = Jer 51:17 gift Prov 25:14 grace of person Prov 31:30 , etc.; ׳ אֹ֫רַח שׁ Ps 119:104 ; Ps 119:128 ׳ דֶּ֫רֶח שׁ v Ps 119:29 ׳ בטח בשׁ Jer 13:25 ׳ נחל שׁ Jer 16:19 , compare also Ps 7:15 ; Ps 33:17 ; Ps 119:118 ; Isa 28:15 לַשֶּׁקֶר for disappointment, in vain 1Sam 25:21 ; Jer 3:23 . 2. deceit, fraud, wrong : ׳ עשׂה (ל) שׁ do or practise fraud, wrong Hos 7:1 ; Jer 6:13 ; Jer 8:8 ; Jer 8:10 with בְ , 2Sam 18:13 ׳ פְּעֻלַּת שׁ Prov 11:18 ׳ לֶ֫חֶם שׁ Prov 20:17 food got by fraud ; ׳ זֶ֫רע שׁ Isa 57:4 ׳ עֵט שׁ Jer 8:8 ׳ ילד שׁ Ps 7:15 (|| עמל ); ׳ דרךְ לשׁון קשׁת שׁ Jer 9:2 ׳ בְּשׁ Jer 3:10 (|| בגד ), adverb שׁקד fraudulently, wrongfully Ps 35:19 ; Ps 38:20 ; Ps 69:5 ; Ps 119:78 ; Ps 119:86 . 3. injurious falsehood , in testimony, especially in courts : עַד שֶׁקֶר Exod 20:16 ( E ) Deut 19:18 ; Ps 27:12 ; Prov 6:19 ; Prov 14:5 ; Prov 25:18 עֵד שׁקרים Prov 12:17 ; Prov 19:5 ; Prov 19:9 ׳ ענה שׁ Deut 19:18 testify falsehood ; ׳ שְׁבֻעַת שׁ Ze Deut 8:17 false oath ; ׳ נשׁבע לשׁ swear falsely Jer 5:2 + 5 t.; ׳ נשׁבע על שׁ Lev 5:22 ׳ דבּר שׁ Mic 6:12 + (see [ דָּבַר ], דָּבָר ); ׳ אִמְרֵ י שׁ Isa 32:7 ׳ שׂפת(י) שׁ Ps 31:19 ; Ps 120:2 ; Prov 10:18 ; Prov 17:7 טפל ׳ שׁ Job 13:4 ; Ps 119:69 , compare v Ps 119:163 absolute false ! 2Kgs 9:12 ; Jer 37:14 . 4. falsity , of false or self-deceived prophets: ׳ נכּא שׁ prophesy falsely Jer 14:14 ; Jer 23:25 ; Jer 23:26 ; Jer 29:21 + ל person Jer 27:10 ; Jer 20:14 ; Jer 20:16 ׳ לַשּׁ ׳ נ v Jer 20:15 ׳ בשׁ ׳ נ Jer 5:31 ; Jer 20:6 ; Jer 29:9 ׳ מוֺרֶה שׁ Isa 9:14 ; Hab 2:18 ׳ חזה שׁ Zech 10:2 ׳ חֲזוֺן שׁ Jer 14:14 , etc., (+ 12 t.); ׳ רוּח שׁ . 5. lie, falsehood , in general: ׳ דבר שׁ Ps 101:7 (|| רְמִיָּה ); ׳ דְּבַר שׁ Prov 13:5 of מִלִּים Job 36:4 ׳ לְשׁוֺן שׁ false tongue Prov 6:17 ; Prov 12:19 ; Prov 21:6 ; Prov 26:28 ; Ps 109:2 of lips Prov 12:22 ׳ אִישׁ שׁ Prov 17:4 liar .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9028')\">BDB9028</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8267')\">H8267</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9027')\">BDB9027</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9029')\">BDB9029</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שֶׁ֫קֶר</bdbheb><sub>113</sub> <b>noun masculine</b> <highlightword>deception, disappointment, falsehood</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 23:7\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(2,23,7)\">Exod 23:7</ref> + 64 t.; <bdbheb>שָׁ֑קֶר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 5:9\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(2,5,9)\">Exod 5:9</ref> + 42 t.; plural <bdbheb>שְׁקָרִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 101:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"101\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"101\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,101,7)\">Ps 101:7</ref> + 3 t.; suffix <bdbheb>שִׁקְרֵיהֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 23:22\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(24,23,22)\">Jer 23:22</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>deception</highlight>, what deceives, disappoints, and betrays one : a molten image <ref ref=\"Jer 10:14\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(24,10,14)\">Jer 10:14</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 51:17\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,17)\">Jer 51:17</ref> gift <ref ref=\"Prov 25:14\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(20,25,14)\">Prov 25:14</ref> grace of person <ref ref=\"Prov 31:30\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(20,31,30)\">Pr